+ *   configured, idle: every 4 ms; not configured (no host): every 20 ms;
+ *     a frame we queue (ud_if_output wakes the thread) polls fast until it is sent;
+ *     the live log alone (TX only, one burst per 100 ms) must not hold the 200 us
+ *     poll: 5000 wakeups a second for no reason (system-features.md);
+ *   raw mode (before the ue0 attach): 1 ms as before.
+ * Bus reset: ENDTRANSFER (FORCERM) on every active data transfer before the
+ * data endpoints go off (Linux dwc3_stop_active_transfers), kill switch
+ * laurelusb_resetend=0. Kill switch laurelusb_poll=0: the old fixed 1 ms poll
+ * (review m7: no tuning boot-args).
+ * The RX ring / TX batch of 0361 and the soft-reconnect watchdog of 0366 are not ported.
